+
+## Boss-A diagnostic candidate (2026-10-14)
+
+This isolated branch is a playable-map build input, not a verified native fix.
+Only the 25 BONE GeosetId values change from Multiple (-1) to the sole geoset 0.
+All geometry, normals, UVs, bindings, pivots, animations, textures, uB24 scale 8.0,
+and gameplay remain unchanged. Multiple is a legal sentinel; this tests a native
+compatibility hypothesis, not a proven malformed-file diagnosis. Every bone's
+actual influence or descendant dependency resolves to geoset 0. GeosetAnimId
+remains None (-1), because this model has no geoset animations.
+
+The output filename and loading subtitle are marked Boss-A诊断. The standard
+map name/build timestamp remain intact. Build only via Run-WurstLinux.py
+(or the authorized Windows entrypoint); do not patch a compiled map.
+Run tools/VerifyEclipseBossCandidate.py --map OUTPUT.w3x --reference-map BASELINE.w3x
+to verify packaged model, texture, exact uB24 model path/scale and unchanged Boss
+objects. Without --map it verifies source bytes only. Native rendering is untested.
+Compare original versus A on the same wave-24 spawn, moving/turning, leaving and
+re-entering the camera, and nearby-unit conditions. Roll back the candidate commit
+to recover the exact original asset (SHA256 b19878db04cfef6dc053d6443281e312f95ff1375dd3f4a38007a29c7ea90406).
